  "body": "We offer a fabulous one bedroom with car park in the Spencer on Byron.\r\nPositioned to catch sunlight and gorgeous views with wraparound viewings to the iconic City lights.\r\nWe even offer the studio next door - an optional extra!\r\n\r\nThe Spencer on Byron is perhaps the most popular apartment complex on the North Shore - and for good reason.\r\nEnjoy resort style facilities including a pool, spa, gym and even tennis court.\r\nA doddle to the beach and to some fabulous bars, restaurants and cafes.\r\nTransport links a plenty too.\r\n\r\nBuy just one or buy them both.\r\nAdvertised price is for the one bedroom with car park.\r\nEnquire for more info on the studio or a joint purchase.\r\nCall James Mairs for more info.",
